# Environment / secrets
# This repo is PUBLIC and the contact form uses a Resend API key. Nothing has
# ever been committed (full history was scanned on 16 Aug 2026 and is clean),
# but without these lines a single local .env.local would be published on the
# next `git add .`. The key lives in Vercel's environment variables only.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Build output / caches
.next/
out/
build/
.vercel/
*.tsbuildinfo

# Dependencies
node_modules/
.pnp
.pnp.js

# Logs
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*

# Testing / coverage
coverage/

# OS / editor cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
.idea/

# Internal working docs - deliberately NOT public.
# These live on the local machine only. CLAUDE.md holds the project's
# non-negotiable rules (British English, no dashes, the SCSS/CSS
# double-definition trap) and the reference doc holds the full architecture
# notes. Several code comments still point at CLAUDE.md by name; that is
# intentional, they are notes to whoever has the file.
# WARNING: because these are untracked, a fresh clone will NOT contain them.
# Keep a backup outside this folder before wiping or re-cloning the repo.
CLAUDE.md
Dev-Vyas-Portfolio-Reference.md
Dev-Vyas-Portfolio-Reference.pdf
